# Never commit game files or binaries — this project stores only files we create.
# Game executables, assets, and archives
*.exe
*.dll
*.bin
*.bik
*.upk
*.u
*.umap
*.xxx
*.tfc
*.int
*.pak
*.tga
*.dds
# Extracted or dumped memory / process data
*.dmp
*.dump
*.raw
# Local scratch
/tmp/
*.log

# ...but recon evidence logs are DERIVED DATA, not scratch run logs. The blanket
# `*.log` above silently swallowed all three logs under
# recon/2026-09-02-first-live-runs/ - including run7-stereo-sep60-two-monkeys.log,
# the evidence behind "the stereo wiggle is proven". A session copied them in
# believing they were saved; `git add` skipped them without complaint and they
# stayed single-disk files. Same defect was found the same day in
# the-evil-within-vr. Negate the rule for recon/ so evidence cannot be lost that way.
!dev-archive/recon/**/*.log
!recon/**/*.log
